# Shared building blocks, registered by name.
#
# Not optional: Quickshell loads files through a virtual filesystem
# (qs:@/qs/tools/...), so QML's implicit "types in my own folder" rule does not
# apply and a component without an entry here fails with "X is not a type".
# The singletons in theme/ and config/ carry the same warning for the same
# reason — this is the third time the project has paid for it.
WaitFor 1.0 WaitFor.qml
# ⚠️ A SINGLETON, and the `singleton` word is not optional — without it QML
# hands out a new instance per import and every reader gets its own idea of what
# the clock format is. theme/qmldir and config/qmldir carry the same line for the
# same reason.
singleton Clock 1.0 Clock.qml
